[00:00.31]Mirage - Ivan Torrent
[00:00.84]Lyrics by：Ivan Torrent Llavero
[00:01.62]Composed by：Ivan Torrent/Ivan Torrent Llavero
[00:21.47]Lost like a desert rose
[00:24.47]Who fights against a sandstorm
[00:28.40]Arid and cold
[00:30.70]I wander through the dunes of grief
[00:35.27]And I carry on
[00:39.03]I just need the memories
[00:43.66]To walk through these fields of dust
[00:48.43]They soothe me if I'm thirsty
[00:52.94]But they're a mirage
[00:57.99]Though I can still feel you
[01:02.60]We're breathing in worlds apart
[01:07.52]You live in that haven
[01:12.17]Where there is no time
[01:16.99]Where it grows greener prairies
[01:22.76]And shines a warmer sun
[01:31.17]Beyond the mirage
[02:15.14]And in the night the whispering breeze
[02:19.55]Turns into your songs
[02:22.07]Echoes of hope
[02:24.40]Nylon and poems of love
[02:27.84]Helped you to carry on
[02:32.77]I look through the mirror
[02:37.39]But it never brings you back
[02:42.00]And this golden meadow
[02:46.99]Feels like a mirage
[02:51.79]'Cause I can still feel you
[02:56.43]Though we breathe in worlds apart
[03:01.12]You live in that haven
[03:05.93]Where there is no time
[03:10.63]There bloom purple roses
[03:16.33]And glows a warmer sun
[03:24.83]Beyond the mirage
[03:48.41]'Cause we no feel you use
[03:54.36]Shout out of my scent
[04:17.09]I beyong mirage
